# Keep sources LF on every platform: gofmt and the CI gate compare against LF.
# Without this, a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true rewrites every Go file
# to CRLF and `gofmt -l cmd internal` reports the whole tree as unformatted.
* text=auto
*.go text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf

# Binary assets must never be normalised.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.db binary
